        "anchor": [
          1300,
          13958.3,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "in real code: one rank gets one batch fewer, an evaluate() on rank 0\nreduces a metric inside, a rank dies of out-of-memory",
      "originalText": "in real code: one rank gets one batch fewer, an evaluate() on rank 0\nreduces a metric inside, a rank dies of out-of-memory",
